---
question: What are your takeaway / delivery options?
order: 3
---
We offer three options for the Ammi's Kitchen takeaway - each option has its own PayPal link in the **[Order Takeaway](/order)** section:

1.  Pick up at Common Ground and BYO packaging (tiffin or three containers)
2.  Pick up at Common Ground and use our packaging
3.  Delivered in our packaging
